WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.900
What does this give the I S S O?

2
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:07.543
The reviewed policy files, the lint's
clean run and the hash of each body sent,

3
00:00:07.543 --> 00:00:11.912
for account management and
least privilege, AC-2 and AC-6.

4
00:00:11.912 --> 00:00:16.762
The member-of scan with zero rows, which
the guide's validate step asks for.

5
00:00:16.762 --> 00:00:19.621
A clean run of the
privileged-package rule,

6
00:00:19.621 --> 00:00:25.912
showing no privileged role reached by
rule, which SCuBA requires under BOD 25-01.

7
00:00:25.912 --> 00:00:28.177
And each mover's residual sheet,

8
00:00:28.177 --> 00:00:33.400
the manager's decisions and the
interval, for personnel transfer, PS-5.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.080
Separation of duties stays in
the package configuration.
